","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 (5851): authored held-out TDD oracle. Happy-path (in tree): tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_startup.py — 5 tests RED (missing review_bot.startup module + adapter runtime param). Held-out (session files/heldout-s5/, OUT of tree): decision_auth (AC3 no-fallback + runtime forwarding), token_nonleak (AC2), rotation (AC4)+telemetry(AC5)+freshness(AC1). Existing-behaviour oracles (AC1/AC2/AC5) GREEN on main; new-behaviour RED. Next: dispatch implementer with happy-path only.","timestamp":1787065232999204001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 (5851): implementer done (3 iters, extracted voter_merge.py; voter.py 791->704 LOC). Held-out validation GREEN: 19/19 (5 happy + 14 held-out). Teeth confirmed: neuter validate_decision_auth -> 4 held-out RED; break adapter runtime forwarding -> forwarding oracle RED; both restored. Running preflight.","timestamp":1787066590461724001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 (5851): preflight GREEN (make lint, make typecheck, verify cmds: 19 review_bot + 94 mcp_auth + 143 regression). Committed 330ba5bd17 (rebar-ticket trailer + DCO + Change-Id I78242ee0). Pushed gerrit change 1861 https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1861 . Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1787066719223588001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S5 (5851): CI patchset 1 FAILED (20 tests: 17 review-bot worker/lifespan/retrigger over-tightened _worker/startup_binding interface + auth-guard firing via stub TypeError; 3 complexity-baseline stale after _review_and_vote extraction dropped below C901). Fixed: app.py reads startup_binding defensively + forwards runtime only when non-None (backward-compat, zero existing tests touched); regenerated complexity baseline via --update-stale (removed vanished _review_and_vote entry; --lock OK, no raised ceilings). Full default suite GREEN (13840+ passed, 0 failed) + lint + typecheck + held-out oracle 19/19. Amended 772f6b8f02, re-pushed patchset 2 to change 1861, released WIP. Awaiting re-gate.","timestamp":1787071969384352001}],"created_at":1787064565791676001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"704df73c-43ea-489e-9b2f-9906c564a7a6","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e215-ab23-ed6a-4791"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","e215-ab23-ed6a-4791"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4f6b-88ea-e3ff-4661","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement RP-04 (e215): finish S5 (5851) + S7 (aabf), land Gerrit stack","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["27d96023-aeb3-47f7-bb13-f84a16a7d959","704df73c-43ea-489e-9b2f-9906c564a7a6","ab5c6052-fb38-46e4-a8fc-9c219c6b5f98","f785456b-468d-4eef-961e-6cd838291baf","4a8ac939-868f-4a28-aa9d-177e16e3b147","43d06257-51fd-40b6-8e57-7f95a71d5fb7"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787071969384352002,"uuid":"5fc2a463-183d-43ec-baf2-eb3cd4db6699"}